[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634456965","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028#issuecomment-1634456965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028","id":1634456965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ha9WF","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-13T15:32:36Z","updated_at":"2023-07-13T15:32:36Z","body":"The license text for this one is a bit odd, given the way it's formatted in the linked file, but I believe this would be the intended text:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncopyright 1999 Donald E. Knuth\r\n\r\nThis file may be freely copied and distributed, provided that\r\nno changes whatsoever are made. All users are asked to help keep\r\nthe MMIXware files consistent and ``uncorrupted,''\r\nidentical everywhere in the world. Changes are permissible only\r\nif the modified file is given a new name, different from the names of\r\nexisting files in the MMIXware package,\r\nand only if the modified file is clearly identified\r\nas not being part of that package.\r\n(The CWEB system has a ``change file'' facility by\r\nwhich users can easily make minor alterations without modifying\r\nthe master source files in any way. Everybody is supposed to use\r\nchange files instead of changing the files.)\r\nThe author has tried his best to produce correct and useful programs,\r\nin order to help promote computer science research,\r\nbut no warranty of any kind should be assumed.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634456965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634462961","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028#issuecomment-1634462961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028","id":1634462961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ha-zx","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-13T15:36:22Z","updated_at":"2023-07-13T15:36:22Z","body":"+1 to add, as a historical and generally permissive license. I had a brief pause at the \"provided that no changes whatsoever are made\" in the first sentence, but the subsequent lines make it clear (to me at least) that the intent is that changes can be made as long as it's given a different name and not implied to be part of the same package.\r\n\r\nI might lean towards `MMIXWare` as the ID and \"MMIXWare License\" as the name, unless there's a specific reason to include Knuth's name in the identifier as well? I'm not familiar with this particular package so any context would be helpful!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634462961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1666027521","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028#issuecomment-1666027521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028","id":1666027521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85jTZAB","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/priva