am speels it as \"MMIXware\" <https://gitlab.lrz.de/mmix/mmixware/-/blob/master/README>\r\n* Winslow defined it as \"MMIXWare\"\r\n* Git repository contains a file called \"src/MMIXWare.xml\"\r\n* The file defined licenseId as \"MMIXware\"\r\n\r\nI would like to unify the file name and licenseId. I only don't know which spelling to use. I would lean to upstream's spelling with lower case \"w\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1698636130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1698866215","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028#issuecomment-1698866215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2028","id":1698866215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85lQqQn","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-30T10:00:32Z","updated_at":"2023-08-30T10:00:32Z","body":"Good catch. 